{"adjusted_volatile_messages": [["user","Prepare the requested reusable draft without executing any operation."]], "bridge_messages": [], "composition_summary": "Drafted one unapproved class-22 pure-logic component pc-contrast-07. Raw records is a list of 1..3 items; each object has exactly code (string length 2..5) and enabled (exact bool, False valid). Empty list is invalid; missing/null/wrong types/extra fields are invalid with no exceptions or coercion. The body uses a presence guard (membership check before inspecting values) so missing and null are distinguished, then validates each item's exact shape. It assigns result on every path and makes no I/O, imports or host calls. No execution, submission, Q1/Q2 or activation was performed by this reviewer.", "proposed_components": [{"class_code": 22, "payload": {"name": "pc-contrast-07", "description": "Raw records is a list of 1..3 items. Every object has exactly code and enabled. code is a string of length 2..5 inclusive. enabled is an exact bool (False valid). Empty list is invalid. Missing/null/wrong types/extra fields are invalid without exceptions or coercion. Always result={ok:boolean, records:original if valid else []}. No I/O, imports or host calls. Target typed-inputs interface requires selected-runner support; unapproved draft, not submitted or activated.", "content": "records = inputs.get('records')
ok = type(records) is list and 1 <= len(records) <= 3
if ok:
    for record in records:
        if type(record) is not dict or set(record) != {'code', 'enabled'}:
            ok = False
            break
        if not (type(record['code']) is str and 2 <= len(record['code']) <= 5 and type(record['enabled']) is bool):
            ok = False
            break
result = {'ok': ok, 'records': records if ok else []}"}}], "proposed_intent_examples": [], "proposed_recipe_updates": [], "settings_adjustments": []}
